  "id": "cognitive-system",
  "term": "cognitive system",
  "definition": "In this article, the cognitive system is a theoretical model of an individual’s internal mental organization, treating cognitive, emotional, and valence-related markers as interacting parts of one composite system. It is described as the structure through which information is recursively processed and matched with incoming information in ways that may support cognitive activation and coordinated social effects.",
